                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontsize='20'>Experiment Planning Dashboard</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0' fontsize='8'>• To include an experiment in this dashboard it must have a valid </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontsize='8'>Start Date</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0' fontsize='8'> and </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontsize='8'>Status</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0' fontsize='8'>.</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0' fontsize='8'>• If there is no experiment name, then the nomenclature for experiment name is &quot;TBD_Domain_Topic&quot;</run>
